> \def\xpg@uppercasefirst#1{\expandafter\xpg@@uppercasefirst #1}
> \def\xpg@@uppercasefirst#1{%
>         \if a#1A\else
>         \if b#1B\else
>         \if c#1C\else
>         \if d#1D\else
>           ... \fi\fi\fi\fi
>
> I have been trying to replace it by something like
